    - :func:`jax.numpy.polyfit`: Least squares polynomial fit.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.poly`: Finds the coefficients of a polynomial with given
      roots.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.roots`: Computes the roots of a polynomial for given
      coefficients.

